  m_name: The drowned King
  m_entryIndex: 894
  m_fullBodyIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad213a1d2513cc54c94f82bc9ac7192b, type: 3}
  m_description: 'A colossal drowned monarch covered in coral, shells, and the remains
    of an entire ship fused to its back. An enormous crown of rusted anchors rests
    upon its head, while one arm has become a massive tentacle and the other wields
    an anchor larger than a house.


    The King can command lesser drowned creatures
    and is nearly invulnerable. Its crown and the ship fused to its body must be
    destroyed before its true weakness is exposed: the Abyss Heart within its chest.'
